        "execSummary":  "HASTE demonstrates that AI-powered geospatial analysis can compress critical humanitarian response timelines from weeks to hours, a use case with direct analogies in enterprise operations such as rapid incident assessment, field service dispatch, and supply chain disruption response. For enterprise leaders evaluating AI ROI, this is a high-credibility example of AI delivering measurable speed-to-outcome in a high-stakes domain. The key implication is that computer vision and sensor data fusion represent an underutilized enterprise pattern, not just a humanitarian one. Organizations managing distributed physical assets or field operations should evaluate similar rapid-assessment architectures.",
