        "execSummary":  "Google\u0027s Research@ 2026 report signals that the company is advancing AI capabilities simultaneously across enterprise, public sector, and frontier research, a portfolio strategy designed to establish platform dominance rather than win any single market. For enterprise and government leaders, the Deep Review deployment at major academic conferences is the most immediately actionable signal: document-scale reasoning at 15,000+ submissions demonstrates readiness for high-volume enterprise knowledge work applications such as contract review, compliance analysis, and technical due diligence. The AMIE clinical AI peer-reviewed study is a marker that AI is entering regulated professional domains with evidentiary standards, which will accelerate enterprise procurement and liability conversations. Watch Project Suncatcher as an early signal of infrastructure investments that could redefine edge AI deployments in the 2028-2030 window.",
