        "execSummary":  "Barclays is one of the clearest enterprise-scale case studies for large-language-model deployment to date, combining developer tooling, employee knowledge management, and high-volume email triage under a single AI platform. The scale, 120,000 emails per day and one million knowledge searches, signals that ROI on agentic AI is now measurable, not theoretical. For enterprise leaders, the takeaway is that phased rollouts anchored to concrete productivity metrics and robust AI governance frameworks are what make board-level commitments stick. The caveat: Barclays explicitly built human oversight into every layer, which adds overhead but is increasingly a regulatory expectation in financial services.",
