        "summary":  "Anthropic released an updated Usage Policy effective November 12, 2026, consolidating restrictions on deceptive campaigns, refining election-related prohibitions, strengthening weapons and surveillance controls, and adding safeguards for autonomous physical actions. The update also adds a new requirement for human-in-the-loop oversight in high-risk domains including health, finance, legal rights, and physical autonomy. A new prohibition on sustained abusive behavior toward Claude models is also included.",
