        "summary":  "Workday announced new AI autopilot agents designed to independently handle finance and HR tasks such as flagging missing payroll data, preparing accounting entries, and managing talent acquisition. The company introduced three offerings: autopilot agents for specific workflows, a Trusted Agent Platform for building custom agents, and Decision Intelligence tools for scenario planning. Early adopter access begins in early 2027 with general availability to follow, and all tools include customer-defined controls and audit logging.",
